    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0164" n="46" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg46"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rives to Mr. Tree.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 24,
                        1888</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 146.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The following telegram was sent you to-day,
                    viz: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">October</hi> 24, 1888.</p>
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tree</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Minister, Brussels:</hi><lb/>Sambolino papers
                            forwarded.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rives.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>You are instructed to make formal application for the surrender of Adolph
                    Sambolino, charged with forgery in the State of New York, and a fugitive from
                    the justice of the United States, to Mr. Charles Heidelberg, or such other
                    person as may be duly authorized to receive him as the agent of this
                    Government.</p>
                <p>The warrant and an authenticated copy of the papers in the case, will be sent
                    from New York to-morrow, the 25th instant, to Antwerp to Mr. Charles Heidelberg,
                    the agent of the Government.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rives.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
